  <name>Murmur AI</name>
  <summary>A 100% local voice-controlled desktop agent</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Murmur AI listens through your microphone, talks back with local speech
      synthesis, and performs computer-control tasks on your behalf. Nothing
      leaves your machine: no cloud APIs, no telemetry, no subscription.
    </p>
    <p>
      Built for eyes-free use: screen-reader-friendly spoken confirmations, a
      plain-text live transcript, and spatial audio cues.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">murmur-ai.desktop</launchable>
